a parcel has a weight, and can be fragile.
a parcel can be urgent and can be heavy.
let box be a new fragile urgent parcel with weight 2.
mark box as not fragile.
say box is fragile, the urgent parcels.
let fee be 4 if box is fragile, otherwise 0.
let price be 5, plus 12 if box is urgent, minus 1 if box is heavy.
